          "Label the degree audit and the requirement list with their versions so a later reviewer can tell a stale extract from a current one. Name the owner for every open item, including items waiting on someone else. Keep the source reference and the coded value in the same row. Name the owner and the date beside each decision. A sample graduation audit checklist review checks the degree audit, the requirement list, and the surviving value in the degree audit system. The educationvirtualassistant coordinator files the dated graduation audit checklist note with the case.",
